Principal changes relative to Trellis:
- Renamed the framework, its project directory (`.arbor/`), command prefix
  (`/arbor:`), environment variables (`ARBOR_*`) and managed-block markers.
- Removed the multi-platform matrix (only Claude Code and StarFactory remain
  as main-agent platforms), the `channel` worker runtime, `mem`, `ablate`,
  `upgrade`, the workflow marketplace and remote spec-template registry.
- Replaced platform-native sub-agents with roles a driver script dispatches
  as Orca workers (`orca orchestration worker-start`), with the task context
  injected into the dispatched prompt.
- Added a parallel execution variant (child tasks in git worktrees).
